;; Tool-build variant of com.sun.org.apache.xalan.internal.xsltc.trax.TemplatesImpl (java-design-1123's XML in javac's
;; tool world; train 4): read by j2g only, in the world of javac's tool build. jdk26u's createModule defines the translets'
;; dynamic module "jdk.translet" in a module layer over a ModuleFinder of one anonymous ModuleReference; the Go build has
;; no java.lang.module layers (ModuleReference, Configuration and ModuleLayer.defineModules are not in the world), and
;; j2g's translation of the finder captured the reference of a class outside the world. The translets go to their
;; loader's unnamed module instead (ClassLoader.getUnnamedModule, jrt's since queue 575), to which TemplatesImpl's
;; module exports the packages translets use (Module.addExports). Copyright (c) the Arbace authors; Eclipse Public
;; License 1.0.
(in-ns 'com.sun.org.apache.xalan.internal.xsltc.trax)

(j2g/variant TemplatesImpl
  (method ^:private createModule ^Module [this ^ModuleDescriptor descriptor ^ClassLoader loader]
    (.getUnnamedModule loader)))
